definitions.text:
**n.1** A carton is a plastic or cardboard container in which food or drink is sold. (盛装卖品的) 盒
**n.2** You can use carton to refer to the carton and its contents, or to the contents only. 盒; 盒装物：He went to the shop for a carton of milk;
**n.3** 硬纸箱

**n**. 法奇软糖，乳脂软糖（用糖、黄油和牛奶制成）;
**v**. 敷衍，装模作样（没有真正解决问题）
**v**. ~ (on) sth 含糊其辞；回避

**n.1** any of the small changes or levels which sth is divided into;
**n.2** the process or result of sth changing gradually
**n.3** 刻度
